# Laid out Medium, the wide frame's tape (sfdesk frame.mbt): MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2, an opened fold's
# inner screen upright (its size classes medium both ways), a finger. The sidebar in use at first: a chat chosen in it
# (it shows in the page beside it, the sidebar still in use), the page's edge tapped (it comes over, nothing under the
# tap pressed), back (the sidebar over again), the page tapped again.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 1300
tapxy -80 420
wait 1300
back
wait 1300
tapxy -80 420
wait 1300
exit
